  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Check your avocado is ripe before starting this recipe (see Cooking tip). Preheat the oven to 220C, fan-forced. Line a large oven tray with baking paper. Pick the coriander leaves and finely chop the stems. Drain and rinse the beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1250164/photos/large/223291_1-bdec663e8a917a75fc37047249c5372e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Season beans: Put the coriander stems, beans, barbecue seasoning and 1½ tbs barbecue sauce in a bowl, season with salt and pepper and stir to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1250165/photos/large/223291_2-95ad1586e497859f2577bb1513a5f7d3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake pizza: Put 2 pita on the lined tray and brush with 1 tsp olive oil. Spread 2 tbs tomato paste over the pita and top with the bean mixture. Bake the pizzas for 10-12 mins until golden and crisp.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1250166/photos/large/223291_3-2980f14898c04c247833c25d9d81a76b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make avocado topping: Meanwhile, coarsely chop the tomato and avocado. Put 1½ tsp red wine vinegar in a large bowl and season with salt and pepper. Add the tomato and avocado and gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1250167/photos/large/223291_4-7318a097c7d00b8bee7ad9f1b843d0db.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Top the pizzas with the avocado topping and vegan sour cream (see Make it yours) and scatter with the coriander leaves. Cut into wedges and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1250168/photos/large/223291_5-dec816b6c2b1258b10b560482b27c7e0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make it yours: We've added a little bit of water to the vegan sour cream so we can drizzle it over the pizzas. Feel free to simply dollop it on instead.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1250169/photos/large/223291_6-843f9a45799301ad0cbdae9676133ba3.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
